  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Adds one life up to 9 and starts bonus_life_timer."},
    {"at":13,"placement":"line","text":"Gives a bonus life when the thousands digit of the score changed, or when the hundreds digit changed from 4: one life each 500 points."},
    {"at":36,"placement":"line","text":"Adds the 6 digits of points_to_add to the score, shows the score in the status line and checks for a bonus life."},
    {"at":71,"placement":"line","text":"SID voice 3 registers $d40e-$d414 of the noise sound that start_crack_sound requests."},
    {"at":78,"placement":"line","text":"Requests the noise sound crack_sound_regs on SID voice 3."},
    {"at":83,"placement":"line","text":"Sets cave_end_state to 2 when the cave time is 0. Plays the tick sound for each of the last 9 seconds."},
    {"at":100,"placement":"line","text":"Plays the tick sound of the last seconds on SID voice 2 unless voice2_busy_timer runs. The pitch rises as the time falls."},
    {"at":134,"placement":"side","text":"Bit 7: voice 2 plays the time tick."},
    {"at":140,"placement":"line","text":"Subtracts 1 from the 3 decimal digits of the cave time, shows them and calls check_time."},
    {"at":145,"placement":"side","text":"Adding 9 with the carry chain subtracts 1 in decimal."},
    {"at":167,"placement":"line","text":"Counts one second of the cave: decrements the time and counts seconds_elapsed. At the amoeba time the amoeba grows fast."},
    {"at":179,"placement":"side","text":"Fast amoeba: 4 chances in 16."},
    {"at":184,"placement":"line","text":"Counts one second of inbox_delay. At 0 it plays the crack sound, ends inbox_waiting and sets play_started."},
    {"at":204,"placement":"line","text":"Shows status_line ($983a) in screen row 0."},
    {"at":216,"placement":"line","text":"Called once in each frame. Each 60 frames, when the game does not pause, it counts the inbox delay or the cave time."},
    {"at":244,"placement":"line","text":"Adds 1 to the 2 decimal digits of diamonds_collected and shows them in the status line."},
    {"at":247,"placement":"side","text":"X is 1 for the ones digit and 0 for the tens: A+carry adds 1 once."},
    {"at":267,"placement":"line","text":"Shows the 2 digits of diamonds_needed in the status line."},
    {"at":280,"placement":"line","text":"Shows the tens and ones of the points of one diamond in the status line."},
    {"at":293,"placement":"line","text":"At the needed diamond count: opens the exit, sets the extra diamond points, shows diamond symbols, plays the crack sound, flashes the screen."},
    {"at":321,"placement":"side","text":"Diamond symbols in place of the needed count."},
    {"at":332,"placement":"side","text":"6 frames of white screen."},
    {"at":337,"placement":"line","text":"SID voice 1 registers of the sound of a collected diamond: frequency, pulse width, control, attack/decay, sustain/release."},
    {"at":339,"placement":"side","text":"play_diamond_sound copies these 4 bytes (pulse width, control, attack/decay) to voice1_regs+2."}
  ],
